&lt;p&gt;However, i can&apos;t reproduce this issue. here&apos;s how i tried.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;1. remove &lt;tt&gt;dependencies&lt;/tt&gt; from &lt;tt&gt;interpreter.json&lt;/tt&gt; in Zeppelin 0.7.0&lt;br/&gt;
2. start Zeppelin.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;And Zeppelin works just fine. In fact, &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/blob/v0.6.2/zeppelin-zengine/src/main/java/org/apache/zeppelin/interpreter/InterpreterSetting.java#L185&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;&lt;tt&gt;dependencies&lt;/tt&gt; exists&lt;/a&gt; in 0.6.2. And &lt;tt&gt;getDependencies()&lt;/tt&gt; returns empty list when the field is null. &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Could you clarify how to reproduce this problem?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
